// BT-4033: the issue repro — a static Supervisor whose anonymous
// `withArgs:` child fails its `initialize`.

Supervisor subclass: Bt4033Sup

  childSpecs =>
    #((Bt4033Opener supervisionSpec
      withId: #o
      withRestart: #transient
      withArgs: #{#port => 1}))
